---
import HobbyOrbit from "./HobbyOrbit.astro";
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="relative flex min-h-screen flex-col justify-center px-6 py-24 md:py-32"
>
  <div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-5xl gap-12 md:grid-cols-[1.15fr_1fr] md:items-center">
    <div>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">About</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 border-l-2 border-accent/40 pl-5 text-slate-600">
        <slot>
          <p>
            Hey there! I'm Andrei, and I try to make the most of everything I
            take part in.
          </p>
          <p>
            I'm currently pursuing an MSc in Data Science at Uppsala University,
            building a deeper understanding of how data describes the world
            around us. I'm endlessly curious about technology and innovation,
            about entrepreneurship and sustainability, and about the ethical
            questions that come with building AI responsibly.
          </p>
          <p>
            I'm not trying to become an expert in one specific technology so
            much as a problem solver who reaches for the right tool for the
            right job, currently as a Data Engineer at Endava. I value autonomy
            and transparency, and I do my best work in teams where I'm
            challenged and given real space to innovate.
          </p>
          <p>
            Besides work and education, I regularly volunteer at and help
            organize European events, bringing talented people together and
            building the space for good ideas to take shape. I'm also a core
            team member of EuroTech Federation, working on community and
            fellowship.
          </p>
          <p>
            Outside of engineering, I read, especially philosophy and classic
            literature, and spend as much time as I can hiking, running, and
            traveling.
          </p>
        </slot>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <HobbyOrbit />
      <p class="mt-6 text-center text-sm text-slate-400">
        Literature, traveling, hiking, running, philosophy, and culture.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
